<p>I think you're right about the -EX. While half the episodes are no longer anomalous, and technically &quot;explained&quot; by being in effect globally, half of them are not. Keter, however, I'll argue. Containing the effects of episodes 1-7 is impossible, because it's already out. Given the virulence of SCP-4228, I'd say it's warranted.</p>
